Slater functional
f(ra=rb) =  c*(2*ra)**a
Functional =  c*(2*sqrt(ra)*sqrt(rb))**a
Diff(ra)   =  a*c*(2*sqrt(ra)*sqrt(rb))**a/(2*ra)
Diff(rb)   =  a*c*(2*sqrt(ra)*sqrt(rb))**a/(2*rb)

Slater exchange functional
g(ra=rb) =  c*(2*ra)**a
Functional =  c*((2*ra)**a + (2*rb)**a)/2
Diff(ra)   =  a*c*(2*ra)**a/(2*ra)
Diff(rb)   =  a*c*(2*rb)**a/(2*rb)
